<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT GERMANY 3-1 IN FED CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS BEAT GERMANY 3-1 IN FED CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic took an unbeatable 3-1 lead over Germany in a Fed Cup tennis World Group one tie after they won the second reverse singles on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results (Czech names first):</p>
<p>Ludmila Richterova beat Barbara Rittner 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Adriana Gersi beat Marlene Weingaertner 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>Richterova lost to Weingaertner 6-3 5-7 3-6</p>
<p>Gersi beat Rittner 6-4 6-2.</p>
</text>
